WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.917
Let's open Al-Anbiya at the page where the
prophets' trials are told, one after another.

00:00:06.917 --> 00:00:36.365
We select from Ayyub's prayer through Yunus and Zakariyya,
and ask what we can learn about patience and turning to Allah.

00:00:36.365 --> 00:00:46.165
Ayyub first: patience doesn't mean hiding your pain.
“You can be patient and still cry, hurt, seek relief.”

00:00:46.165 --> 00:00:53.365
Yunus: when the hardship follows your own
mistake, turning back to Allah is still open.

00:00:53.365 --> 00:01:00.465
Zakariyya: patience doesn't mean you stop hoping for something deeply.

00:01:00.465 --> 00:01:07.765
And the pattern through all three: each one called out, and Allah answered.
